  FT["PH-H2840"] = {"id":"PH-H2840","coverage":"full","language":"en","sourceName":"LawPhil 菲律宾法律虚拟图书馆（The LawPhil Project – Arellano Law Foundation）","sourceUrl":"https://lawphil.net/statutes/repacts/ra1961/ra_3363_1961.html","fetchedAt":"2026-10-06","articleCount":2,"structureMode":"ARTICLE","title":{"zh":"设立Banga市","en":"An Act Creating the Barrio of Sibaliw in the Municipality of Banga, Province of Aklan","orig":"An Act Creating the Barrio of Sibaliw in the Municipality of Banga, Province of Aklan","vi":"Đạo luật thành lập một Barrio Sibaliw tại Đô thị Banga, Tỉnh Aklan","th":"พระราชบัญญัติจัดตั้งบาริโอ Sibaliw ในเทศบาล Banga จังหวัด Aklan","id":"Undang-Undang membentuk sebuah Barrio Sibaliw di Kotamadya Banga, Provinsi Aklan","ms":"Akta menubuhkan sebuah Barrio Sibaliw di Perbandaran Banga, Wilayah Aklan"},"level":"law","status":"active","topics":["general"],"docNumber":"Republic Act No. 3363","issuingBody":"Congress of the Philippines","promulgatedDate":"1961-06-18","completenessNote":"全文，共 2 条；逐字取自 LawPhil 菲律宾法律虚拟图书馆（The LawPhil Project – Arellano Law Foundation） 官方页面（statutes/repacts/ra1961/ra_3363_1961.html），未改写、未摘译、未节选；原文语言：英语。 条文抬头依源文为 “Section N.” 等形式，本库统一规范为 “Section N.”；首行抬头与条内标题的分段依源文块级边界还原。","country":"PH","countryName":"菲律宾","layer":"intl","articles":[{"id":"PH-H2840-A1","no":1,"noLabel":{"en":"Section 1."},"text":{"en":"The sitio of Banga in the Municipality of Banga, Province of Aklan, is converted into a barrio of said municipality to be known as the barrio of Sibaliw. This barrio is bounded on the North by the Panatalian Creek, on the East by the old sitio cemetery, on the South by the boundary line of the Municipality of Balete, and on the West by the sitio of Badiangan in barrio Tarralba."}},{"id":"PH-H2840-A2","no":2,"noLabel":{"en":"Section 2."},"text":{"en":"This Act shall take effect upon its approval.\nApproved: June 18, 1961."}}],"pack":"ph-p40"};
