  FT["PH-H2867"] = {"id":"PH-H2867","coverage":"full","language":"en","sourceName":"LawPhil 菲律宾法律虚拟图书馆（The LawPhil Project – Arellano Law Foundation）","sourceUrl":"https://lawphil.net/statutes/repacts/ra1961/ra_3390_1961.html","fetchedAt":"2026-10-06","articleCount":2,"structureMode":"ARTICLE","title":{"zh":"设立Balabac市","en":"An Act Creating the Barrio of Bugsuk in the Municipality of Balabac, Province of Palawan","orig":"An Act Creating the Barrio of Bugsuk in the Municipality of Balabac, Province of Palawan","vi":"Đạo luật thành lập một Barrio Bugsuk tại Đô thị Balabac, Tỉnh Palawan","th":"พระราชบัญญัติจัดตั้งบาริโอ Bugsuk ในเทศบาล Balabac จังหวัด Palawan","id":"Undang-Undang membentuk sebuah Barrio Bugsuk di Kotamadya Balabac, Provinsi Palawan","ms":"Akta menubuhkan sebuah Barrio Bugsuk di Perbandaran Balabac, Wilayah Palawan"},"level":"law","status":"active","topics":["general"],"docNumber":"Republic Act No. 3390","issuingBody":"Congress of the Philippines","promulgatedDate":"1961-06-18","completenessNote":"全文，共 2 条；逐字取自 LawPhil 菲律宾法律虚拟图书馆（The LawPhil Project – Arellano Law Foundation） 官方页面（statutes/repacts/ra1961/ra_3390_1961.html），未改写、未摘译、未节选；原文语言：英语。 条文抬头依源文为 “Section N.” 等形式，本库统一规范为 “Section N.”；首行抬头与条内标题的分段依源文块级边界还原。","country":"PH","countryName":"菲律宾","layer":"intl","articles":[{"id":"PH-H2867-A1","no":1,"noLabel":{"en":"Section 1."},"text":{"en":"The sitio of Bugsuk in the Municipality of Balabac, Province of Palawan, is converted into a barrio of said municipality, to be known as the barrio of Bugsuk."}},{"id":"PH-H2867-A2","no":2,"noLabel":{"en":"Section 2."},"text":{"en":"This Act shall take effect upon its approval.\nApproved: June 18, 1961."}}],"pack":"ph-p40"};
